/-!
# Permutation certificates for marked outer HS fusion

For each of the two outer representatives, the five permutations are the
fusion conjugator, the residual involution, its conjugator from the central
HS involution, and two odd-order fixed elements whose product is that involution.
Graph preservation and parity certify membership in the exact degree-100 HS
carrier. Every finite identity is checked in Lean's kernel.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, proof of 16.4.9(2), printed pp.1190–1191,
and the HS outer rows of 16.1.5(10), p.1172. The retained GAP calculation
in `source/discover.g` supplies witnesses only; `source/witnesses.json`
records their zero-based images.
-/

